WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:03.837
♪ I've been playing soccer
on a hot summer day. ♪

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:06.548
♪ I love a frozen fruit pop
right after I play. ♪

00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:07.382
Who doesn't?

00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:08.884
♪ But even though
I want one, ♪

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:10.510
♪ I just stand at the sink. ♪

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.722
♪ 'Cause I'm so hot and tired
that I can't even think. ♪

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:16.975
♪ In case I can't remember
how to cool myself down, ♪

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:20.437
♪ I wrote the steps on paper;
I can pass them around. ♪

00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:23.649
♪ Read me the instructions
and I'll follow along, ♪

00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:27.027
♪ and I'll have my refreshment
by the end of the song. ♪

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:28.695
♪ We get where you're going. ♪

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.322
♪ We'll get in a line ♪

00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:34.701
♪ and read the instructions
one page at a time. ♪

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:37.371
♪ Open up the freezer door. ♪

00:00:37.371 --> 00:00:40.707
♪ Get out the pop
that you're looking for. ♪

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:43.418
♪ Have a taste 
and shout hooray! ♪

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:44.002
Hooray?

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:46.338
♪ Take off the wrapper
and throw it away. ♪

00:00:46.338 --> 00:00:48.382
[KASSI GROANS]
♪ That wasn't as refreshing ♪

00:00:48.382 --> 00:00:50.133
as I would have thought. ♪

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:51.718
♪ But we can solve a problem ♪

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:53.428
♪ with the steps
that we've got. ♪

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:56.598
♪ The secret is the sequence,
the order they're in. ♪

00:00:56.598 --> 00:01:00.102
♪ So rearrange the sequence
and we'll sing it again. ♪

00:01:00.102 --> 00:01:03.313
♪ We need a new sequence, 
so mix up the line ♪

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:07.693
♪ and read the instructions
one page at a time. ♪

00:01:07.693 --> 00:01:10.362
♪ Open up the freezer door. ♪

00:01:10.362 --> 00:01:13.573
♪ Get out the pop
that you're looking for. ♪

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:16.827
♪ Take off the wrapper
and throw it away. ♪

00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:19.663
♪ Have a taste
and shout hooray! ♪

00:01:19.663 --> 00:01:23.041
♪ Hooray! ♪

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:26.295
♪ Hooray! ♪

00:01:26.295 --> 00:01:28.255
Hooray!

00:01:28.255 --> 00:01:30.382
♪ Helpsters! ♪

00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:35.804
♪

